00:00:55.367 --> 00:00:56.567
-That's good.
-Make sense?

00:00:56.567 --> 00:00:57.701
-Yeah.
-Any questions?

00:00:57.701 --> 00:00:58.968
We want to have --
-Okay. Great.

00:00:58.968 --> 00:01:00.667
Renee and Jimmy
-Yeah --

00:01:00.667 --> 00:01:01.901
