00:01:11.334 --> 00:01:13.767
-[ Air whooshes ]
-We got this, bud. We got this.

00:01:13.767 --> 00:01:14.834
-Alright. Ready?

00:01:14.834 --> 00:01:16.033
-Well, that was
amazing technology.

00:01:16.033 --> 00:01:17.234
