just had a card up there.

00:01:18.734 --> 00:01:20.267
-No, no, no.
But this is a tube.

00:01:20.267 --> 00:01:22.000
-I understand.
-Because it's called "Jinx."

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:23.834
-Yep.

00:01:23.834 --> 00:01:26.267
-So, okay, ready?
-Yes. We got this.

00:01:26.267 --> 00:01:28.434
-Put your minds together.
The category is...

00:01:28.434 --> 00:01:31.400
