-Yeah, yeah.

00:04:19.834 --> 00:04:21.701
-There's a little communication
going on there.

00:04:21.701 --> 00:04:24.634
-Okay. This is
something people collect.

00:04:24.634 --> 00:04:27.634
Something people collect.

